OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry and settled night with light
OL,7,Fwinds. Mostly cloudy skies, though
OL,8,Fsome clear intervals are possible.
OL,9,FChilly in places under light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA dry and mostly cloudy
OL,12,Fmorning with some brightness. Cloud
OL,13,Flowering and becoming thicker in the
OL,14,Fafternoon, some fog patches and
OL,15,Fdrizzle by evening. Winds
OL,16,Fstrengthening through the day.
